  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "RTMPT: Fix infinite loop",
  "description": "The RTMPT dissector when over TCP reuses the TCP sequence numbers, but\ndoesn't consider wraparound, which can occur both with the\ntcp.relative_sequence_numbers preference set to FALSE, or in some\nunusual cases (such as a SYN packet with a bogus sequence number so\nthat later packets overlap its sequence number.)\n\nBreak out of a particular loop if the sequence numbers wraparound.\nFix #17745.",
